not part of the input.
Suppose that all diﬀerences ri − rj, i ̸= j are units in R. Then using fast inter-
polation and evaluation, the problem can be solved using O(M(d) logd) operations
in R. We propose an improved solution, in the special case when r0,... ,r d form an
arithmetic progression; its complexity is in O(M(d)), so we gain a logarithmic factor.
