1.4 A remark about Factorials and Integer Factoring
The relation between factorial evaluation and integer factoring begins with Strassen’s observation
[14] that the baby-step/giant-step product method can also factor integers. IfN = p1p2 with
p1<p 2, then
p1≤⌊
